<title>UK: British Gas shares gain on takeover talk.</title>
<headline>British Gas shares gain on takeover talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Gas rose in pre-market trading on Monday after weekend press reports of a possible bid from oil giant Shell.</p>
<p>British Gas shares were up 5-1/2p at 214-1/2 by 0811 GMT while Shell was down 1/2p at 985-1/2.</p>
</text>
